{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>Speak to all the congregation of the children of Israel.</b> This teaches that this section was stated in assembly, because most of the corpus of Torah depends on it (Sifra)." "<b>You shall be holy.</b> Be separated from the forbidden sexual relations and from sin, for everywhere you find a fence against forbidden sexual relations you find holiness — ״אִשָּׁה זֹנָה וַחֲלָלָה וגו׳ אֲנִי ה׳ מְקַדִּשְׁכֶם״ (Leviticus 21), and ״וְלֹא יְחַלֵּל זַרְעוֹ, אֲנִי ה׳ מְקַדְשׁוֹ״ (there), ״קְדֹשִׁים יִהְיוּ, אִשָּׁה זֹנָה וַחֲלָלָה״ (there)."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 19, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:07:02.982938171Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}